        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.19.5+GEN.19.6+GEN.19.7+GEN.19.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Icite 19:5-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo bacilifye balesansamuka, ifiwelewele fimo ifya baume fyafumine mu musumba no kushinguluka iŋanda. Bayambile ukulapumaula ku ciibi, no kulabilikisha ku mukote uwali umwine wa ŋanda no kutila, “Fumya uyo umwaume uwishile mumobe pakuti tulale nankwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe umukote asukile afumina panse, no kubeba ukuti, “Iyoo, mwe bacibusa bandi, tecakwesha ukucita ici cintu icabipa ifyo. Pantu uyu muntu mulendo wandi, te cisuma ukucita icamusebanya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moneni, ine ninkwata umwana wandi umukashana nacisungu, elyo no mukashi wakwe uo ashaupile mu bwinga, ebo lekeni mupeele pakuti mucite mwe bene fintu mulefwaya, lelo kuli uyu mwaume tecakwesha ukucitako icintu icamusebanya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo ifi fibantu ifyaume fyalikene ukumfwa kuli uyu umukote. Elyo uyu umwina Levi abuulile umukashi wakwe uo ashaupile mu bwinga no kumufumisha panse kuli bena, nabo basendeme nankwe kumaka no kumwangasha ubushiku bonse, mpaka bwaca ku macaca elyo bamulekele ukuya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo bwacele ulucelo uyu mwanakashi elyo abwelele ku ŋanda ukwali shikulu wakwe, no kuya wa pa mwinshi wa ŋanda no kulala palya pene mpakafye ilyo akasuba kabalike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo shikulu wakwe abukile ulucelo, no kwisulako iciibi pakuti atampeko kulaya ulwendo lwakwe, amwene umukashi wakwe uo ashaupile mu bwinga nalala, nawa mu mwinshi wa ŋanda natambalika na maboko yakwe mu mwinshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo amweba ukuti, “Ima, natuleya!” Lelo takwali bwasuko. Elyo amubikile pali punda wakwe, aima no kuya fika kumwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
